\nLet's recall the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${sin}^{2}$ term: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)={sin}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }5{sin}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{sin}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{(x-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x)|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}([\\pi -\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )]-[0-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot 0)]) \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\pi }{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534781 true] [17592186309803 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309804 13194139534781 true] [17592186309803 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309805 13194139534781 true] [17592186309803 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309806 13194139534781 true] [17592186309803 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309807 13194139534781 true] [17592186309803 1000 #edb/ref 17592186309808 13194139534781 true] [17592186309803 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534781 true] [17592186309803 1041 "selection" 13194139534781 true] [17592186309803 1104 #edb/ref 17592186309808 13194139534781 true] [17592186309803 1110 #uuid "9d94537d-95f9-5179-95cd-10d218124d7e" 13194139534781 true] [17592186309804 1034 "\\frac{3\\pi }{2}" 13194139534781 true] [17592186309804 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534781 true] [17592186309804 1111 #uuid "88151861-75ad-5e5d-a049-e83aa028ef9a" 13194139534781 true] [17592186309805 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139534781 true] [17592186309805 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534781 true] [17592186309805 1111 #uuid "47c6df3b-118b-536b-ab2e-a17e3c312238" 13194139534781 true] [17592186309806 1034 "\\pi " 13194139534781 true] [17592186309806 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534781 true] [17592186309806 1111 